msgid "No virtual machines defined in qemu:///system."
msgstr "qemu:///system 中尚未定义虚拟机。"

msgid "Manage existing virtual machines. Resource usage refreshes every 5 seconds."
msgstr "管理已有虚拟机，资源消耗每 5 秒自动刷新。"

