msgid "CPU: 100% equals one host logical core. Host RSS is the QEMU process memory, not guest memory usage. Rates appear after two samples; unavailable counters show —."
msgstr "CPU 100% 表示占用一个宿主逻辑核心。宿主实际占用为 QEMU 进程内存，并非虚拟机内部内存使用量。速率在两次采样后显示，无法获取的数据显示为 —。"

msgid "Shutdown and reboot require guest ACPI support or a guest agent. An accepted request does not mean the operation has completed."
msgstr "关闭和重启需要虚拟机支持 ACPI 或运行 guest agent。请求被接受并不代表操作已经完成。"
